# AC-2 — Upload validation

Covered by `MediaRulesTest`, `JavaMediaImageProcessorTest`, `AdminMediaControllerTest`, `MediaIT`:

- accepted: JPEG, PNG, WebP; normalized content types
- rejected: SVG, GIF, video/other types -> `415`
- rejected: >15 MB -> `400`; >36 MP / >6000 side / <800x600 -> `422`/`400`
- corrupt image with allowed magic bytes -> `422` and original removed
- complete after upload expiry -> `409 media.upload_expired`
- invalid stored object -> `FAILED` + original deleted; no public copy
- FRONT_DESK upload/complete -> `403`
- `MediaStorageException` -> `503 media.storage_unavailable`

Result: PASS.
